@ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5048

GET {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

### Default title order
GET {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/paintings?page=1&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json

###

### Price ascending
GET {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/paintings?page=1&pageSize=12&order=PriceAsc
Accept: application/json

###

### Price descending
GET {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/paintings?page=1&pageSize=12&order=PriceDesc
Accept: application/json

###

### Year ascending
GET {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/paintings?page=1&pageSize=12&order=YearAsc
Accept: application/json

###

### Year descending with filters
GET {{ArtGallery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/paintings?page=1&pageSize=12&order=YearDesc&search=horizon&medium=oil&minPrice=1000000&maxPrice=20000000
Accept: application/json

###
